{"version":1,"content":"<p>中共二十屆五中全會前夕，官方通報，中共北京市委常委、副市長夏林茂涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，目前正接受中央紀委國家監委紀律審查和監察調查。</p><p>夏林茂身兼中共中央候補委員。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:34.401574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:40.427111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:35.407203+00:00","content_hash":"3649d91318763845efd4cafa3bc2a11c9fa587f5760a5c5fedd804ab0f65c7b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}